    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d443-a5">

                <pb facs="0792" n="696" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg696"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5 in No. 108.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Robertson to Mr.
                            Bingham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Oriental Bank Corporation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Yokohama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 8,
                        1874</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I hereby certify that draft GL. 06764, £26,984 7<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>.
                        6<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>., has to-day been issued in favor of the
                    Hon. John A. Bingham, being the equivalent of $130,833.33 at the current
                    exchange of 4<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi>. 1½<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>.
                    per dollar.</p>
                <p>For the Oriental Bank Corporation:</p>
                <closer><signed>J. ROBERTSON,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Agent.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>N. B.—I have given you the advantage of the rise in rate since the date of
                        the accompanying brokers’ letters, as arranged.</p>
                    <closer><signed>J. R.</signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
